WEBVTT

00:02:56.005 --> 00:03:00.134
And as it stands,
our public education system

00:03:00.134 --> 00:03:02.678
is not cultivating future leaders.

00:03:03.429 --> 00:03:05.056
And in particular,

00:03:05.097 --> 00:03:10.228
students of color are constantly
devalued and marginalized.

00:03:12.396 --> 00:03:15.608
Regardless of background,

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:20.905
students need to envision themselves
as successful in life.

00:03:22.156 --> 00:03:27.620
And how teachers deliver the lessons
plays a big role in that.

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:29.997
The most common way to teach